{"id": "draft-c13-01", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "裂项级数与求和", "concept_id": "C13", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "problem": "求$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\arctan\\frac1{n^2+n+1}$的精确和，并给出前$N$项后的精确余项。", "solution": "令$\\delta_n=\\arctan(n+1)-\\arctan n$，有$0<\\delta_n<\\pi/2$，且$\\tan\\delta_n=((n+1)-n)/(1+n(n+1))=1/(n^2+n+1)$。由主值范围得$\\delta_n=\\arctan(1/(n^2+n+1))$，不能只由正切相等而忽略整周差。故$S_N=\\arctan(N+1)-\\pi/4$；取极限得$S=\\pi/4$。余项$R_N=S-S_N=\\pi/2-\\arctan(N+1)=\\arctan(1/(N+1))$，后一等式同样用正数主值范围确定。", "answer": "$S=\\pi/4$，$R_N=\\arctan(1/(N+1))$。", "method": "反正切差的非有理裂项", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "反三角主值分支+精确余项", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["$\\arctan(n+1)-\\arctan n$", "$S_N=\\arctan(N+1)-\\pi/4$", "$S=\\pi/4,R_N=\\arctan(1/(N+1))$"], "steps": ["推导正切差并检查主值区间。", "写有限部分和的完整抵消式。", "取极限得到精确角度。", "给互余角形式的精确余项。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "ea1fbf12a582fc528867e20e2345e2efe981affc78aa78f160c35096bddcd7f4", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c13-01", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01ce