{"id": "draft-c13-02", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "裂项级数与求和", "concept_id": "C13", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "problem": "求级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n(n+1)(n+2)}$ 的和。", "solution": "重组分解：$\\frac{1}{n(n+1)(n+2)}=\\frac12\\left(\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}-\\frac{1}{(n+1)(n+2)}\\right)$(通分核对:分子差为 $(n+2)-n=2$)。前 $N$ 项和 $S_N=\\frac12\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\left(\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}-\\frac{1}{(n+1)(n+2)}\\right)=\\frac12\\left(\\frac12-\\frac{1}{(N+1)(N+2)}\\right)$。令 $N\\to\\infty$ 得 $S=\\frac12\\cdot\\frac12=\\frac14$。", "answer": "和为 $\\frac14$。", "method": "重组分解裂项(二阶相邻抵消)", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "分解结构变化:三重线性因子需先重组为相邻二阶因子的差分", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["板书:级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{1}{n(n+1)(n+2)}$", "板书:重组分解 $\\frac12(\\frac{1}{n(n+1)}-\\frac{1}{(n+1)(n+2)})$ 与通分核对", "动画:相邻项抵消划线", "板书:$S_N=\\frac12(\\frac12-\\frac{1}{(N+1)(N+2)})$", "高亮框:$S=\\frac14$"], "steps": ["第一步:写出级数,构造相邻二阶因子的差分分解。", "第二步:通分核对分解的正确性(分子差为 $2$)。", "第三步:展开前 $N$ 项,动画标出抵消对。", "第四步:整理部分和并取极限。", "第五步:高亮结论 $S=\\frac14$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "ef2745264f1359540566be4759e6fe3e5a5afb40290369c1467b8c7d3a9f46e9", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c13-02", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c13-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "b5d34498df739ccfba79dab0c24591f9d17c39a2c660a883090f27e859ae24b9", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c13-03", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "裂项级数与求和", "concept_id": "C13", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "problem": "求级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{(n+1)!}$ 的和。", "solution": "重组：$\\frac{n}{(n+1)!}=\\frac{n+1-1}{(n+1)!}=\\frac{1}{n!}-\\frac{1}{(n+1)!}$。前 $N$ 项和 $S_N=\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\left(\\frac{1}{n!}-\\frac{1}{(n+1)!}\\right)=\\frac{1}{1!}-\\frac{1}{(N+1)!}=1-\\frac{1}{(N+1)!}$。令 $N\\to\\infty$ 得 $S=1$。", "answer": "和为 $1$。", "method": "阶乘型裂项(分子重组)", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "分解结构变化:分子重组出相邻阶乘倒数之差(非部分分式路径)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["板书:级数 $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{n}{(n+1)!}$", "板书:分子重组 $\\frac{n}{(n+1)!}=\\frac{1}{n!}-\\frac{1}{(n+1)!}$", "动画:相邻项抵消划线(阶乘结构)", "板书:$S_N=1-\\frac{1}{(N+1)!}$", "高亮框:$S=1$"], "steps": ["第一步:写出级数,把分子写成 $(n+1)-1$。", "第二步:拆成两个阶乘倒数之差,展示化简。", "第三步:展开前 $N$ 项,动画标出抵消对。", "第四步:整理得 $S_N=1-\\frac{1}{(N+1)!}$。", "第五步:取极限,高亮结论 $S=1$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "c18549753bf2b624d2be76e205b92129d27ab90dd5c2bdd706faadac9fb7715c", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c13-03", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c13-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "9bf1ec19c34321b598b50f429a71d9e57b61e0aa3ba398fc261b832b0165e17c", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c13-04", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "裂项级数与求和", "concept_id": "C13", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "problem": "求$\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}(\\sqrt{n+2}-2\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt n)$的和，证明绝对收敛，并给精确余项。", "solution": "令$d_n=\\sqrt{n+1}-\\sqrt n=1/(\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt n)$。$d_n>0$且严格递减趋于零，通项为$d_{n+1}-d_n<0$。有限和$S_N=d_{N+1}-d_1=1-\\sqrt2+1/(\\sqrt{N+2}+\\sqrt{N+1})$。因此$S=1-\\sqrt2$，且$\\sum|d_{n+1}-d_n|=d_1=\\sqrt2-1$，绝对收敛。精确尾项$R_N=S-S_N=-1/(\\sqrt{N+2}+\\sqrt{N+1})$；其绝对值就是对应正分数，未用渐近截断。", "answer": "$S=1-\\sqrt2$，绝对值级数和$\\sqrt2-1$；$R_N=-1/(\\sqrt{N+2}+\\sqrt{N+1})$。", "method": "平方根序列二阶差分裂项", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "非有理二阶差分+同号绝对收敛", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["$d_n=1/(\\sqrt{n+1}+\\sqrt n)$", "$S_N=d_{N+1}-d_1$", "负和与正绝对值和的对照"], "steps": ["有理化定义一阶差分并证明递减。", "二阶差分的有限和抵消。", "由符号得到绝对收敛。", "给精确尾项与符号。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "c3c17708bf8511c03382146e2a259e52531f64f5197ff371952a1d9dacc6e3f8", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c13-04", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c13-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "c02122a7f9049c1da358fcd8173dcb855cc07961e1534fb84a2bba1ba5069526", "previous_hold_reasons": ["IDENTICAL_SERIES_REINDEXED"], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c13-05", "category": "数学分析", "sub_category": "级数", "concept": "裂项级数与求和", "concept_id": "C13", "parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "problem": "证明不存在有理函数 $R\\in\\mathbb R(t)$ 使 $\\frac1{t^2+1}=R(t)-R(t+1)$。由此说明该级数不能用这类有理函数裂项直接求和。再用精确不等式证明 $S=\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1{n^2+1}<2$。", "solution": "若存在这样的$R$，把等式视为复有理函数恒等式。把$R$的有限极点按等价关系$a\\sim b\\iff a-b\\in\\mathbb Z$分组。在任一等价类内，$R(t)$的留数之和与$R(t+1)$的留数之和相同，因为极点平移$a\\mapsto a-1$不改变该类且不改变留数。因此$R(t)-R(t+1)$在每个类中的留数总和必须为$0$。但$1/(t^2+1)$在$t=i,-i$的留数分别为$1/(2i),-1/(2i)$，且$2i\\notin\\mathbb Z$，两极点属于不同类，各类留数总和均非零，矛盾。故不存在这样的实有理函数$R$。这不排除超出有理函数有限差分框架的其他方法。对于级数，$0<\\frac1{n^2+1}<\\frac1{n(n-1)}$（$n\\ge2$），而$\\sum_{n=2}^N\\frac1{n(n-1)}=1-\\frac1N$。比较判别得收敛，且至少$n=2$的差为$\\frac12-\\frac15=\\frac3{10}>0$，从而$S=\\frac12+\\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty}\\frac1{n^2+1}<\\frac12+1=\\frac32<2$。此外，其和有精确表达式。取$f(x)=\\cosh x$在$[-\\pi,\\pi]$上的周期延拓，其余弦系数为$a_0=\\frac{2\\sinh\\pi}{\\pi}$，$a_n=\\frac2\\pi\\int_0^\\pi\\cosh x\\cos(nx)\\,dx=\\frac{2(-1)^n\\sinh\\pi}{\\pi(1+n^2)}$（$n\\ge1$）。周期延拓连续且分段光滑，由傅里叶级数收敛定理，在$x=\\pi$有$\\cosh\\pi=\\frac{\\sinh\\pi}{\\pi}+\\frac{2\\sinh\\pi}{\\pi}\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty}\\frac1{1+n^2}$。因此$S=\\frac{\\pi\\coth\\pi-1}{2}$，其中$\\coth\\pi=\\cosh\\pi/\\sinh\\pi$。", "answer": "不存在上述实有理函数有限差分裂项。精确和为$S=\\frac{\\pi\\coth\\pi-1}{2}$，且$0<S<\\frac32<2$。", "method": "有理函数有限差分的极点留数反证+严格比较界", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "反例辨析:不可裂项情形的判定理由,并用裂项法反向给出上界", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["限定方法：$R\\in\\mathbb R(t)$、$R(t)-R(t+1)$", "两个极点$i,-i$，$2i\\notin\\mathbb Z$", "每个整数平移类的留数和：差分应为$0$，目标不为$0$", "精确比较：$\\frac1{n^2+1}<\\frac1{n(n-1)}$，$n\\ge2$", "结论：$S<\\frac32<2$", "补充精确值：$S=(\\pi\\coth\\pi-1)/2$，由$\\cosh x$余弦系数在$x=\\pi$求和得到"], "steps": ["第一步：明确只判断有理函数有限差分裂项，不把无实一次因式当作所有方法不可能。", "第二步：按整数平移等价类整理极点，说明差分的类内留数总和为零。", "第三步：计算目标在$i,-i$的留数，得到矛盾。", "第四步：展示从$n=2$起的严格比较及有限部分和$1-1/N$。", "第五步：取极限，保留确定的正差，推出精确严格界$S<3/2<2$。", "第六步：展示精确傅里叶系数与端点求和值，推出闭式；不以截断数值代替证明。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "637830f816cf5b177273422c18ea17180a07bff3657b8b2112639d59173fc16d", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c13-05", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c13-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["calc-series-019"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "6b8b0a9d19aceb37fec0b15d3bb89339487d79c5b4486d421f903ebaafe1f6d1", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": ["限定裂项方法并给严格不可能证明，替换错误因式论断和估算用语", "补傅里叶端点推导的精确和(πcothπ−1)/2，避免只有上界没有和式"], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c18-01", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "平面", "concept": "点到平面距离与投影", "concept_id": "C18", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "problem": "求空间中到$P=(0,0,0)$与$Q=(2,0,0)$的距离都恰为$1$的全部平面，并给出两点在这些平面上的投影。", "solution": "到原点距离为$1$的任意平面可唯一选朝向写成$ax+by+cz=1$，其中$a^2+b^2+c^2=1$。到$Q$的距离条件为$|2a-1|=1$，故$a=0$或$a=1$。若$a=1$，单位条件给$b=c=0$，平面为$x=1$，两投影均为$(1,0,0)$。若$a=0$，全部平面为$by+cz=1$、$b^2+c^2=1$；法向$n=(0,b,c)$为单位向量，两投影分别为$P+n=(0,b,c)$与$Q+n=(2,b,c)$。逐一验证法向长度与平面方程，距离均为$1$。这两类穷尽上述归一化条件的全部解。", "answer": "$x=1$，两投影同为$(1,0,0)$；或$by+cz=1,b^2+c^2=1$，投影分别$(0,b,c)$、$(2,b,c)$。", "method": "给定两点距离的逆向平面族分类", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "未知单位法向+离散与连续两类平面", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["两点$P,Q$及中间平面$x=1$", "连续平面族$by+cz=1$", "约束$a^2+b^2+c^2=1$及两分支"], "steps": ["归一化平面法向与常数。", "用两个距离条件得到$a=0$或$1$。", "分类全部平面及投影。", "验证每类的距离并证明穷尽。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "fd28d2b07737ce1f188b32dbcb1ed82da2e09d40763c265930016d2fae73d95e", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c18-01", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c18-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "0de23cd04d0fba45cb1c722596eb646e0c734403e86b5472d90149f3f4fa9aaf", "previous_hold_reasons": ["DIRECT_METHOD_REUSE"], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c18-02", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "平面", "concept": "点到平面距离与投影", "concept_id": "C18", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "problem": "求两平行平面 $\\pi_1:2x-y+2z=1$ 与 $\\pi_2:2x-y+2z=5$ 之间的距离。", "solution": "两平面法向量相同，为平行平面。取 $\\pi_1$ 上一点(如 $P_1=(0,-1,0)$:代入 $0-(-1)+0=1$)，点 $P_1$ 到 $\\pi_2$ 的有向距离为 $\\frac{2\\times0-(-1)+2\\times0-5}{\\sqrt{4+1+4}}=\\frac{-4}{3}$，绝对值 $\\frac43$ 即两平面间距离。(亦可用公式 $\\frac{|d_1-d_2|}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}}=\\frac{|1-5|}{3}=\\frac43$。)", "answer": "距离为 $\\frac43$。", "method": "平行平面距离(常数项差/法向量模)", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "对象变化:点到平面推广为两平行平面间距离", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["三维坐标系(带刻度)", "两个半透明平行平面(蓝色与橙色)", "绿色垂线段连接两平面(标注长度 $\\frac43$)", "法向量箭头 $n=(2,-1,2)$", "板书:$\\frac{|1-5|}{\\sqrt{4+1+4}}=\\frac43$"], "steps": ["第一步:画出两个平行平面,显示共同法向量 $(2,-1,2)$。", "第二步:取 $\\pi_1$ 上一点 $P_1=(0,-1,0)$,计算其到 $\\pi_2$ 的有向距离。", "第三步:展示常数项差公式 $\\frac{|d_1-d_2|}{|n|}$。", "第四步:画出两平面间的绿色垂线段。", "第五步:高亮结论 $\\frac43$。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "7f7259db375b192f8446524e81b14ccd7169d45e93b6427fc1ccbad39e059ec3", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c18-02", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c18-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "93b50ededb503998291ec37bfdd1851a6cd4135a95fa5ac458bf3a1bc144e4ab", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c18-03", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "平面", "concept": "点到平面距离与投影", "concept_id": "C18", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "problem": "求过点 $P(1,2,3)$ 且垂直于方向 $v=(2,1,-1)$ 的平面方程；并求该平面与过原点、方向为 $v$ 的直线的交点。", "solution": "以 $v=(2,1,-1)$ 为法向量、过 $P(1,2,3)$ 的平面为 $2(x-1)+(y-2)-(z-3)=0$，即 $2x+y-z-1=0$。直线参数化 $(2t,t,-t)$，代入平面方程：$4t+t+t-1=0$，得 $6t-1=0$，$t=\\frac16$，交点为 $(\\frac13,\\frac16,-\\frac16)$。验证:该点满足 $2x+y-z-1=\\frac23+\\frac16+\\frac16-1=0$。", "answer": "平面 $2x+y-z-1=0$;交点为 $(\\frac13,\\frac16,-\\frac16)$。", "method": "反向构造平面+线与平面求交", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "逆向任务:由垂直方向反求平面,再求直线与平面的交点(即原点的投影)", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["三维坐标系(带刻度)", "蓝色点 $P(1,2,3)$ 与方向箭头 $v=(2,1,-1)$", "半透明平面 $2x+y-z-1=0$(垂直于 $v$)", "红色直线(过原点,方向 $v$)", "黄色交点 $(\\frac13,\\frac16,-\\frac16)$"], "steps": ["第一步:标出点 $P$ 与方向向量 $v$。", "第二步:以 $v$ 为法向量写出过 $P$ 的平面方程。", "第三步:画出平面与过原点的红色直线。", "第四步:参数化直线并代入平面方程,解得 $t=\\frac16$。", "第五步:黄色圆点标出交点并验证。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "18ab502a1cd7c0a8020c9419df5a694a00e84bd5dd643d1580872b6363d2ca09", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c18-03", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c18-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "131c4a2a84f2466e3807d7181f93c68fcc39f8aa863c5156b3ae8006a7e45176", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c18-04", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "平面", "concept": "点到平面距离与投影", "concept_id": "C18", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "problem": "设$P=(1,2,3)$，平面$\\pi:x+y+z=0$。在加权距离$d_W(P,X)^2=(X-P)^{\\mathsf T}W(X-P)$、$W=\\operatorname{diag}(1,2,3)$下求唯一最近点与距离，并证明全局唯一性。", "solution": "令$n=(1,1,1)^{\\mathsf T}$，$n^{\\mathsf T}W^{-1}n=1+1/2+1/3=11/6$。置$\\lambda=(n\\cdot P)/(n^{\\mathsf T}W^{-1}n)=36/11$，$Q=P-\\lambda W^{-1}n=(-25/11,4/11,21/11)$，其坐标和为零。对任意$X\\in\\pi$，$(P-Q)^{\\mathsf T}W(X-Q)=\\lambda n\\cdot(X-Q)=0$。所以$d_W(P,X)^2=d_W(P,Q)^2+(X-Q)^{\\mathsf T}W(X-Q)$；$W$正定，等号当且仅当$X=Q$。这证明全局最近性与唯一性。最小平方距离为$(n\\cdot P)^2/(n^{\\mathsf T}W^{-1}n)=216/11$，距离为$\\sqrt{216/11}=6\\sqrt{66}/11$。加权法向是$W^{-1}n$，不能错误套用欧氏投影移动方向$n$。", "answer": "$Q=(-25/11,4/11,21/11)$，$d_W(P,\\pi)^2=216/11$，$d_W(P,\\pi)=6\\sqrt{66}/11$。", "method": "正定度量下的平面投影", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "加权度量改变投影方向+正交平方唯一性", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["$W=\\operatorname{diag}(1,2,3)$", "加权法向$W^{-1}n$", "投影$(-25/11,4/11,21/11)$", "平方距离$216/11$"], "steps": ["计算加权法向和归一化分母。", "构造候选投影并检验平面方程。", "证明加权正交勾股分解。", "得到精确距离及唯一性。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "f493d8c1103dd68755cad9a213b862a0c26642fad1c79007aa4b09e9f3556837", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c18-04", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c18-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "bc28b62982fa160ea1bd5f0894a85523d27bd7c4558e0f2a7a4eb18b56710a85", "previous_hold_reasons": ["POINT_LINE_NOT_C18_POINT_PLANE"], "math_correction_notes": ["补两约束与全局最近点验证，统一P−Q/Q−P符号"], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c18-05", "category": "解析几何", "sub_category": "平面", "concept": "点到平面距离与投影", "concept_id": "C18", "parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "problem": "证明空间中任意一点$P$到平面$\\pi=\\{X:n\\cdot X=c\\}$（$n\\ne0$）的最近点存在且唯一，并推导正交投影及距离公式。", "solution": "设$\\pi=\\{X:n\\cdot X=c\\}$、$n\\ne0$。定义 $\\lambda=\\frac{n\\cdot P-c}{\\|n\\|^2}$、$Q=P-\\lambda n$。则$n\\cdot Q=c$，故$Q\\in\\pi$。对任意$X\\in\\pi$，$n\\cdot(X-Q)=0$，即$X-Q\\in\\ker(n^{\\mathsf T})$；且$(P-Q)\\cdot(X-Q)=\\lambda n\\cdot(X-Q)=0$。因此$\\|P-X\\|^2=\\|P-Q\\|^2+\\|X-Q\\|^2\\ge\\|P-Q\\|^2$，等号当且仅当$X=Q$。这同时证明存在、垂直性、最近性和唯一性。投影公式 $Q=P-\\frac{n\\cdot P-c}{\\|n\\|^2}n$，距离 $d(P,\\pi)=\\frac{|n\\cdot P-c|}{\\|n\\|}$。两个平面上点的差向量属于线性空间$\\ker(n^{\\mathsf T})$，不能说属于一般仿射平面$\\pi$。", "answer": "$Q=P-\\frac{n\\cdot P-c}{\\|n\\|^2}n$是唯一最近点；$d(P,\\pi)=\\frac{|n\\cdot P-c|}{\\|n\\|}$。", "method": "存在唯一性证明+正交分解", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "证明型:投影存在唯一性的严格证明与公式推导,非数值计算", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["三维示意图:平面 $\\pi$ 与点 $P$", "板书:构造 $Q=P-\\lambda n$(法向量方向移动)", "板书:$n\\cdot Q=c$(落在平面上)与 $(P-Q)\\cdot(X-Q)=0$(垂直性)", "唯一性和最近性：$\\|P-X\\|^2=\\|P-Q\\|^2+\\|X-Q\\|^2$，等号仅在$X=Q$", "高亮框:投影公式与距离公式"], "steps": ["第一步:画出平面与点 $P$,标注法向量 $n$。", "第二步:构造候选投影点 $Q=P-\\lambda n$,验证其落在平面上。", "第三步:对任意 $X\\in\\pi$ 验证 $(P-Q)\\perp(X-Q)$,即垂直性。", "第四步：由正交勾股等式同时推出全局最近点和唯一性，差向量属于$\\ker(n^{\\mathsf T})$。", "第五步:高亮投影公式与距离公式,完成证明。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "8367f58d564e8d817b149c0756f9d37f23cac28cd663b778816aabc0ffbf53e4", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c18-05", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c18-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["geom-023"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "30f001fabd12d61afd9c2cba8e836c4ffdb5e8bf841ecdd1dd2460a1ce22b6ad", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": ["修仿射平面/差向量混淆，以正交勾股等式证明最近性与唯一性", "场景板书统一平面常数c，修掉遗留n·Q=d"], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c30-01", "category": "高等代数", "sub_category": "多项式", "concept": "多项式平移展开", "concept_id": "C30", "parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "problem": "求次数不超过$5$、在$x=1$至少有三重零点、在$x=2$至少有二重零点且$f(0)=1$的全部实多项式，并写成$x-1$的幂。", "solution": "零点重数给$(x-1)^3(x-2)^2\\mid f$。由次数上界，$f=c(x-1)^3(x-2)^2$；$f(0)=1$给$-4c=1$，即$c=-1/4$。令$u=x-1$，则$f=-u^3(u-1)^2/4=-u^5/4+u^4/2-u^3/4$。因为$c\\ne0$且两个因子互素，重数分别恰为$3$与$2$。所有条件均验证，且常数被唯一确定，故解唯一。", "answer": "$f=-\\frac14(x-1)^3(x-2)^2=-\\frac14(x-1)^5+\\frac12(x-1)^4-\\frac14(x-1)^3$，唯一。", "method": "重数约束的Hermite型平移重建", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "两个节点的重数条件+次数与归一化唯一性", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["重数$3,2$与次数$\\le5$", "$f(0)=1$归一化", "关于$u=x-1$的有限恒等式"], "steps": ["把重数条件改写为整除条件。", "由次数上界限制为一个常数倍。", "归一化确定常数并平移展开。", "验证精确重数和唯一性。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "e15ce999256e86cefe8f79d3e42c0001aa8ef7f082b095bcf5ac8b69f5e0d822", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c30-01", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c30-01", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "57320599bd5b6b2ca4cc97446dc1dd0f91cbdf0d819a4b5be958a99c93427340", "previous_hold_reasons": ["DIRECT_POLYNOMIAL_SHIFT_TEMPLATE", "SECONDARY_FINITE_TAYLOR_TEMPLATE"], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c30-02", "category": "高等代数", "sub_category": "多项式", "concept": "多项式平移展开", "concept_id": "C30", "parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "problem": "对$f(x)=x^4-4x^3+7x^2-6x+3$，求所有使$f(h+t)=f(h-t)$对每个实数$t$成立的实数$h$，并给关于该中心的展开。", "solution": "$f(h+t)$的三次项系数为$4h-4$。若关于$t$为偶函数，该系数必为零，故$h=1$是唯一可能值。直接展开$f(1+t)=t^4+t^2+1$，所有奇次项为零，确满足$f(1+t)=f(1-t)$。因此唯一中心为$1$，平移展开$f(x)=(x-1)^4+(x-1)^2+1$。必要条件与代入验证共同给全体解，不能只检查局部导数为零而漏掉其他奇次项。", "answer": "唯一中心$h=1$；$f(x)=(x-1)^4+(x-1)^2+1$。", "method": "由平移奇偶性反求中心", "difficulty": "基础", "variant_kind": "未知中心+全部奇次系数约束", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["函数恒等式$f(h+t)=f(h-t)$", "三次系数$4h-4$", "$f(1+t)=t^4+t^2+1$"], "steps": ["将反射对称条件解释为平移后的偶性。", "用三次项系数给唯一候选中心。", "完整展开验证所有奇次项消失。", "给精确恒等式及穷尽性。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "a84668c7d7f6cfd781aafc37562a47cdcccd8df7976b5350b57a2545d9c70254", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c30-02", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c30-02", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "d30d8b592e1f903b913e1d9a92e2b81f3eb9daf7142626cf6b643d3f1f27f410", "previous_hold_reasons": ["FINITE_TAYLOR_DEGREE_CENTER_VARIANT"], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c30-03", "category": "高等代数", "sub_category": "多项式", "concept": "多项式平移展开", "concept_id": "C30", "parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "problem": "在次数不超过$3$的实多项式空间上定义$\\Delta f(x)=f(x+1)-f(x)$。证明$\\Delta^4=0$但$\\Delta^3\\ne0$，并求满足$\\Delta f=3x^2+5x+2$、$f(0)=2$的全部$f$。", "solution": "若$f$非恒定且次数为$m$，首项系数为$c\\ne0$，二项式展开给$\\Delta f$的次数恰为$m-1$，首项系数为$mc$。因此在该四维空间上$\\Delta^4=0$；且$\\Delta^3(x^3)=6\\ne0$，指数恰为$4$。设$f=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d$，则$\\Delta f=3ax^2+(3a+2b)x+(a+b+c)$。与目标比较得$a=1,b=1,c=0$，而$f(0)=2$给$d=2$。故$f=x^3+x^2+2$。若两个解存在，其差被$\\Delta$消去；降阶结论说明差为常数，归一化又给常数为零，故唯一。", "answer": "$\\Delta^4=0,\\Delta^3(x^3)=6$；唯一$f=x^3+x^2+2$。", "method": "有限平移差分算子的逆问题", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "精确次数降阶+幂零指数+规范化重建", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["$\\Delta f=f(x+1)-f(x)$", "次数降阶与$\\Delta^4=0$", "$f=x^3+x^2+2$"], "steps": ["用有限二项式展开证明精确降阶。", "证明幂零指数恰为$4$。", "比较差分系数求多项式。", "用差分核与初值证明唯一。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "bd4c8507625d92dfcf6c7a96bb57d506edb1e9a205edbfb1e1f41bbc1d4979a8", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c30-03", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c30-03", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "5064bd1c41925ac8ff210d011b217668a8aea2daf25486cff981883c48731eec", "previous_hold_reasons": ["PARENT_TEMPLATE_REUSE"], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c30-04", "category": "高等代数", "sub_category": "多项式", "concept": "多项式平移展开", "concept_id": "C30", "parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "problem": "已知多项式 $f$ 在 $x=1$ 处的展开为 $f=2+3(x-1)+(x-1)^2-(x-1)^3$。求 $f$ 按 $x$ 的幂展开的标准形式，并求 $f(1)$、$f'(1)$、$f''(1)$。", "solution": "令 $y=x-1$，$f=2+3y+y^2-y^3$，回代 $y=x-1$ 并展开:$2+3(x-1)+(x-1)^2-(x-1)^3=2+3x-3+(x^2-2x+1)-(x^3-3x^2+3x-1)=-x^3+4x^2-2x+1$。由展开式直接读系数:$f(1)=2$，$f'(1)=3$，$f''(1)/2!=1$ 即 $f''(1)=2$。验证:对标准形式求导 $f'(x)=-3x^2+8x-2$，$f'(1)=3$;$f''(x)=-6x+8$，$f''(1)=2$，一致。", "answer": "$f=-x^3+4x^2-2x+1$;$f(1)=2$，$f'(1)=3$，$f''(1)=2$。", "method": "逆向重建(展开式还原标准形式)", "difficulty": "中等", "variant_kind": "逆向任务:由平移展开反求标准形式与各阶导数值", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["板书:$f=2+3(x-1)+(x-1)^2-(x-1)^3$", "板书:逐项展开 $(x-1)^2$、$(x-1)^3$ 与合并过程", "高亮框:$f=-x^3+4x^2-2x+1$", "板书:由平移展开系数直读 $f(1),f'(1),f''(1)$", "验证板书:对标准形式求导核对"], "steps": ["第一步:写出平移展开式,令 $y=x-1$。", "第二步:逐项展开各次幂,动画归组合并。", "第三步:高亮标准形式 $-x^3+4x^2-2x+1$。", "第四步:由平移展开系数直读各阶导数值。", "第五步:对标准形式求导验证,两路一致。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "c1bae6b43fe5e26fac328e14980a9ec307cc38908628cc9df2c709b3da7be971", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "PRIOR_VERIFIED_MATH_UNCHANGED_AFTER_LATEX_NORMALIZATION", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c30-04", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c30-04", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "cefc7db9cd26a872a3675e54cf1c99f6e7da15394fec83432600e6b21d467514", "previous_hold_reasons": [], "math_correction_notes": [], "revised_in_place": false, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
{"id": "draft-c30-05", "category": "高等代数", "sub_category": "多项式", "concept": "多项式平移展开", "concept_id": "C30", "parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "problem": "证明非恒定实多项式没有非零实周期。再求全部满足$f(x+1)+f(x-1)=2f(x)$对所有实数$x$成立的实多项式。", "solution": "设非恒定$f$次数为$m\\ge1$、首项系数$c\\ne0$。若$h\\ne0$，有限展开给$f(x+h)-f(x)$的$x^{m-1}$系数为$cmh\\ne0$，故该差不可能为零多项式，非零周期不存在。对第二个恒等式，若$m\\ge2$，$f(x+1)+f(x-1)-2f(x)$的次数恰为$m-2$，首项系数为$cm(m-1)\\ne0$，故不可能恒为零。次数至多$1$的多项式$f(x)=ax+b$直接代入均满足。因而全体解为任意实$a,b$的仿射多项式，包含常数与零多项式。以上比较的是有限多项式系数，不使用渐近近似。", "answer": "非恒定实多项式无非零实周期；第二个方程的全部解为$f(x)=ax+b$（$a,b\\in\\mathbb R$）。", "method": "平移恒等式的刚性与次数分类", "difficulty": "进阶", "variant_kind": "全次数恒等式+周期反证+中心差分核", "scene_spec": {"objects": ["最高系数$cmh$", "中心差最高系数$cm(m-1)$", "全部解$f=ax+b$"], "steps": ["比较一次平移差的最高非零系数。", "推出非恒定多项式无非零周期。", "比较中心二阶差的最高非零系数。", "验证并给出所有次数至多一的解。"]}, "source": "self-authored", "license": "Internal-Research-Use-Only", "draft_status": "CODEX-REPAIR-v1-NOT-ADMITTED", "strict_review": {"core_math_verified": true, "exact_expression_required": true, "rational_numbers": "fractions_or_integers", "user_review_new_version": "PENDING", "render_verified": false, "admitted": false, "source_batch": "batch-04", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "text_math_fields_reviewed": true, "scene_text_reviewed": true, "math_content_sha256": "8ff427046c219fcdbbe95f844d90f1dc879d637b92b78461ca99d22d90463b02", "math_review_evidence": "reviews/codex-supervision/2026-10-05-batch-repair-execution/exact-reverification.json", "verification_basis": "NEW_GENERAL_PROOF_AND_EXACT_SYMBOLIC_RECHECK", "admission_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_USER_DIVERSITY_ASSET_ACCEPTANCE"}, "review_disposition": "MATH_VALID_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "versioned_id": "codex-repair-20261005-batch-04-draft-c30-05", "revision_lineage": {"source_path": "reviews\\2026-10-05-training-diversity-drafts\\batch-04\\draft.jsonl", "source_sha256": "4a8930a557e05b01cec58257879ecd5bd9679b9c08e3e478767c363642ebe382", "original_id": "draft-c30-05", "prior_parent_training_ids": ["linalg-052"], "historical_risk_not_reset": true, "prior_corrected_record_sha256": "1f2b736e90cde63f8b0637d3065889774361f6241d77385802cffdee93c596fb", "previous_hold_reasons": ["NON_POLYNOMIAL_NOT_C30", "DIRECT_METHOD_REUSE"], "math_correction_notes": ["加精确余项和阿贝尔端点合法性，指出非多项式考点归属错误；跨集重用仍须换题"], "revised_in_place": true, "version": "codex-repair-v1", "additional_recheck_reason": null}, "review_status": "REVISED_DRAFT_PENDING_VERSION_BOUND_ACCEPTANCE", "admitted": false, "animation_render_verified": false}
